1
00:00:15,456 --> 00:00:18,908
Tu es fâchée, Marinette ?
Are you angry, Marinette?

2
00:00:19,008 --> 00:00:24,548
Non, je suis surprise. Tu as l’air nerveux.
No, I'm surprised. You look nervous.

3
00:00:24,648 --> 00:00:29,900
Oui, je suis nerveux, mais je suis fier de notre projet.
Yes, I'm nervous, but I'm proud of our project.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,108
Moi, je suis un peu jalouse : tu as fini avant moi !
I'm a little jealous: you finished before me!

5
00:00:35,208 --> 00:00:40,916
Ne sois pas fâchée. Je peux t’aider : je suis patient.
Don't be angry. I can help you: I'm patient.

6
00:00:41,016 --> 00:00:47,396
Merci ! Tu es poli et généreux, mais parfois paresseux.
Thanks! You're polite and generous, but sometimes lazy.

7
00:00:47,496 --> 00:00:52,556
C’est vrai. Max est méchant quand il est jaloux.
That's true. Max is mean when he's jealous.

8
00:00:52,656 --> 00:00:56,516
Oui, mais il n’est pas toujours méchant.
Yes, but he isn't always mean.
